activeHopTarget stage 6: refactor the stage-5 section to a helper `stage5HopMaps(snapshot)` returning {owners, lanes}, then stage 5 uses it, stage 6 host-less uses it, stage 6 hosted builds shifted maps.

The stage-5 section currently:
```js
if (snapshot.stage === 5) {
